[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721098287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114704#issuecomment-3721098287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114704","id":3721098287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dy3Qv","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T22:34:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T22:34:36Z","body":"I believe Unity has the [same issue](https://ifunny.co/picture/9n9X1kVm9).\n\nIt's a fundamental problem when handling floating-point coordinates. While some kind of workaround might be possible, but I don't think it should be treated as a bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721098287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721255150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114704#issuecomment-3721255150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114704","id":3721255150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dzdju","user":{"login":"Xiexe","id":5119787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTk3ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5119787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe","html_url":"https://github.com/Xiexe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xiexe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T23:26:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T23:27:01Z","body":"> I believe Unity has the [same issue](https://ifunny.co/picture/9n9X1kVm9).\n> \n> It's a fundamental problem when handling floating-point coordinates. While some kind of workaround might be possible, but I don't think it should be treated as a bug.\n\nUnity does exhibit this issue, but it does not support 64 bit precision. I see no reason why gizmos should exhibit this behavior here, and think it should absolutely be considered a bug.\n\nI believe that when building with double precision it's expected that all features of the engine will work at the level of doubles, including gizmos. Double precision is capable of representing coordinates with ~1mm precision out to a distance of Pluto from from the origin, which is something like 5,900,000,000,000 meters.\n\nIf you want verifiable proof of my claim on the precision level, you can use [this calculator](http://www.ehopkinson.com/cgi-bin/floatprecision_htmlout?float=5%2C900%2C000%2C000%2C000) which will show you the minimum possible change of floats, and doubles at any given distance from origin. (in this case, 0.00097, which is almost exactly 1mm)\n\nA simple fix would be to render all gizmos relative to the camera, which would fix the issue even if the engine was built only with 32 bit precision. I would do it, but my C++ is rough and I'm not sure where to even look to see where the gizmo rendering logic is.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721255150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721334010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114704#issuecomment-3721334010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114704","id":3721334010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dzwz6","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T00:05:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T00:05:32Z","body":"For rendering Node3DGizmo, we primarily use ArrayMesh. And for certain gizmos like Skeleton3D, we apply a vertex shader to hack the drawing order.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721334010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723917722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114704#issuecomment-3723917722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114704","id":3723917722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d9nma","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T13:37:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T06:53:39Z","body":"I've made an MRP:\n\n[gizmo-jitter.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24496400/gizmo-jitte